// Deal or Force - regions whose English name was somebody else's as well.
//
// These are the rows keying by id was for. `region.<id>.name` beats the English name, so
// a lake and the province it sits in can finally be told apart - Lake Ontario and Ontario
// shared one row until now, and so did Lake Van and Van, Lake Volta and Volta, and six
// more pairs. Two are outright corrections: RU-ALT is Altai KRAI and was labelled Altai
// Republic, which is its neighbour, and Madagascar's Sofia is not Bulgaria's.
//
// Loaded after 22_regions_by_id.json, which is generated; hand-written rows go here so a
// regeneration never overwrites them.
